://x.com/toyoaki4477/status/1792463760801808516/photo/1\n\n具体的なイメージですが https://skeb.jp/@pocopocoing/works/13\nこちらを見て依頼しようと思いました、元気なイメージでお願いします。\n\nまた可能であればきなこさんがYouTubeのサムネ等活動で使用していただけるように\n許可をいただければと思います。\n許可を頂けるのであれば透過画像もつけて頂けると助かります。\n\nお忙しい時期に恐れ入りますが、ご対応いただければ幸いです。\nきなこさんの何かしらの記念日にプレゼントしようと思ってますのでその際にポストします。\nよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nきなこさんのX\nhttps://x.com/Kinako_dango7/status/1677195218104508417?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pocopocoing/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dd609699/uploads/origins/659ca6eb-2919-4119-8540-425eeba43865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a26b3e87f9123bbc9a3101a0018c3218", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dd609699/uploads/origins/659ca6eb-2919-4119-8540-425eeba43865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a26b3e87f9123bbc9a3101a0018c3218, https://si.imgix.net/dd609699/uploads/origins/659ca6eb-2919-4119-8540-425eeba43865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f54ef0f80a7dcbef1012b62e7547a433 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dd609699/uploads/origins/659ca6eb-2919-4119-8540-425eeba43865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f473ec8fe5173bdf0e229c5af38a124 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello!\nI would like to see another work featuring ヘラジカ as a smug mesugaki loli.\nPlease make her wear the clothes from this image: https://skeb.jp/@choco_pai24/works/33\nThese include a sports bra, spats (スパッツ) and a choker with an antler shaped accessory.\nI would like for her to be pulling up the sports bra in order to reveal one of her nipples in order to tease the viewer. I would like for the lifting to be to the side, so that only one nipple is shown. However, her nipple should be covered by a bandaid (絆創膏).\nIf possible, I would like a variant where the bandaid is not there and her nipples are visible.\nAnything else you would like to do is fine.\nTh